    <h2>The dining room stays open</h2>

    <p>The web was built for humans. It will continue to serve humans beautifully. Nobody is suggesting you replace your website with a Markdown file.</p>
    <p>But the delivery window is about to become the busiest part of the restaurant. And right now, most websites are forcing every delivery rider to sit down, order from the full menu, wait for the appetiser, compliment the wine selection, and then finally take the food.</p>

    <div class="pull-quote">
      The question isn't whether this happens. It's whether your infrastructure is ready when it does.
